48	
49	- **Blazing Fast**: Searches billions of vectors in milliseconds.
50	- **Simple, Just Works**: [Install](#-installation) and start searching in seconds. Pure local, no servers, no config, no fuss.
51	- **Dense + Sparse Vectors**: Support dense and sparse embeddings, multi-vector queries, and a rich selection of [vector index types](https://zvec.org/en/docs/...
52	- **Full-Text Search (FTS)**: Native keyword-based full-text search — query string fields with natural-language or structured expressions.
53	- **Hybrid Search**: Fuse vector similarity, full-text search, and structured filters in a single query for precise results.
54	- **Durable Storage**: Write-ahead logging (WAL) guarantees persistence — data is never lost, even on process crash or power failure.
55	- **Concurrent Access**: Multiple processes can read the same collection simultaneously; writes are single-process exclusive.
56	- **Runs Anywhere**: As an in-process library, Zvec runs wherever your code runs — notebooks, servers, CLI tools, or even edge devices.
